 the original  sinister six in spider-man 3. dr octopus  electro  and sandman are all a part of the  original sinister six  and the other three interestingly enough  are vulture  mysterio and craven the hunter now  vulture is already there michael  keaton's character adrian toombs already  exists within the mcu  and also apparently in the sony pictures  universe of marvel characters as well  but vulture is already there in the  marvel cinematic universe so it won't be  hard to recruit him  for a sinister six team then we have  mysterio who of course exists within the  mcu he was the main villain in  spider-man far from home  but many believe him to be dead i  however do not  i don't think that the master of  illusions really died at the end of far  from home  i think there's a really good chance  that he could be alive which means he  could be a part of the sinister six in  spider-man 3.  and then we have craven the hunter now  craven the hunter is said to be the  original  sole villain of spider-man 3. this was  before the idea of  the multiverse and spider-verse came in  in fact at one point in time it was  reported that sony and  marvel were looking for a joel kinnaman  type of actor to play the role of craven  the hunter  well even though it doesn't look like  he's going to be the sole main villain  of spider-man 3 he is going to be a  villain  as part of the sinister six if these  rumors end up being true which it would  make sense that we're going to have  many villains with the rumors that toby  maguire's spider-man  and andrew garfield spider-man are going  to be returning now moving on to that  topic the topic of toby mcguire  spider-man it was reported a couple of  weeks ago that andrew garfield and toby  mcguire were on set  filming for spider-man 3. well that  might not be  the entire case as of right now because  toby maguire was just spotted  in la he was out for a hike with a  friend and the paparazzi snagged a photo  of him  now this photo is copyrighted by  justjared.com so i can't show it but  he is in la right now now could he have  been filming and gone back  sure it's not hard for him to take a  private jet or charter a jet and fly  back home and then fly back to atlanta  to film  in fact that may be what the studio  wants him to do in order to  kind of throw everybody off but right  now it's a little unclear if toby has  already started filming for spider-man 3  or if he hasn't yet but we'll have to  wait and see  and last but not least we do have some  leaked set photos from the set  of spider-man homecoming 3 which  seemingly confirmed that spider-man 3  will at least  in part be somewhat of a christmas movie  or at least shot during the christmas  period  we have some leaked set photos of a  donut and pastry shop  labeled peter pan donut and pastry shop  now what's interesting  is this is an actual pastry shop in  brooklyn new york the design of the shop  is a little bit different in real life  but the name  how it is is exactly the same so they're  recreating in atlanta  a brooklyn donut and pastry shop and as  you can see from the photo it says  merry christmas on one of the windows  and has hot chocolate on the other along  with other christmas decorations  so spider-man 3 at some point is going  to be during the christmas period  and this makes sense if they're going to  try and make it a little bit emotional  christmas is a time where you usually  spend with your family  but if peter is on the run and he can't  be with his family or his friends  that could add to a lot of emotionality  for him in this movie  and those are our spider-man 3 updates  for today be sure to subscribe so you  don't miss out on any of the latest  spider-man 3 news  and of course other marvel news as well  be sure to let me know what you think  about all these recent reports do you  think  daredevil is going to show up or do you  think it's just going to be matt murdock  and how excited would you be if  spider-man  fought 